{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00162",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 5.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Come in, come in. Pull the door closed behind you, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.39,
      "end_seconds": 9.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.33,
      "end_seconds": 12.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.64,
      "end_seconds": 26.26,
      "duration_seconds": 13.62,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, honestly, it's pain in my left wrist after a fall, and my family pushed me to come. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.15,
      "end_seconds": 30.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.31,
      "end_seconds": 38.92,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "It's been about four days, I'm fairly sure. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.26,
      "end_seconds": 49.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.62,
      "end_seconds": 66.06,
      "duration_seconds": 15.44,
      "text": "Moving it definitely sets it off. It settles a little with holding it still. It's once or twice a day. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.64,
      "end_seconds": 70.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.12,
      "end_seconds": 85.57,
      "duration_seconds": 14.45,
      "text": "Okay, so for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.91,
      "end_seconds": 95.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any bump to the head, numbness or pain in the shoulder?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.83,
      "end_seconds": 99.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.71,
      "end_seconds": 103.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 105.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.69,
      "end_seconds": 125.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.79,
      "end_seconds": 129.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.18,
      "end_seconds": 132.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.44,
      "end_seconds": 139.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.82,
      "end_seconds": 141.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.76,
      "end_seconds": 146.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.69,
      "end_seconds": 148.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.11,
      "end_seconds": 150.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "I've never smoked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.44,
      "end_seconds": 166.11,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.66,
      "end_seconds": 168.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "So, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.2,
      "end_seconds": 170.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.32,
      "end_seconds": 172.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.24,
      "end_seconds": 178.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.53,
      "end_seconds": 180.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Shellfish, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.55,
      "end_seconds": 185.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.55,
      "end_seconds": 188.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.43,
      "end_seconds": 190.42,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.3,
      "end_seconds": 192.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.16,
      "end_seconds": 198.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.63,
      "end_seconds": 208.62,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.99,
      "end_seconds": 214.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.29,
      "end_seconds": 224.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.47,
      "end_seconds": 248.71,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.9, heart rate 70, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pressure 125 over 69."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.73,
      "end_seconds": 252.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.2,
      "end_seconds": 253.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.3,
      "end_seconds": 283.06,
      "duration_seconds": 13.76,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.44,
      "end_seconds": 285.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.51,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 18.48,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your left wrist after a fall for about four days, and no numbness or bump to the head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.83,
      "end_seconds": 308.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.43,
      "end_seconds": 312.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.93,
      "end_seconds": 319.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.6,
      "end_seconds": 324.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Let's get an X-ray of the wrist, for wrist injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.87,
      "end_seconds": 326.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.88,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.88,
      "end_seconds": 340.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.95,
      "text": "I'm prescribing paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day, for five days. You take it by mouth. That's for wrist pain. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.24,
      "end_seconds": 343.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.42,
      "end_seconds": 354.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "I'd like you to wear a splint until the X-ray result is confirmed and keep the hand raised. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.07,
      "end_seconds": 373.6,
      "duration_seconds": 18.53,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. I'll also refer you to the orthopaedic clinic. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently. Please come and see me in a week. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.02,
      "end_seconds": 383.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.12,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 650 milligrams, three times a day and come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.47,
      "end_seconds": 388.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Good. Call the clinic if you need us in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 390.42,
      "end_seconds": 394.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.22,
      "end_seconds": 395.99,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}